WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,560
It turns out that Elder Danyangzi wanted to break through

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:03,120
Have you ever endured such pain?

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,320
If you don’t want to become fertilizer in Master’s medicinal field

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,320
It’s okay to give up now

5
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,720
Since Elder Danyangzi can survive

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,050
I can do it too

7
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:13,050
Master's medicine is not just that

8
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:23,310
Aren't you giving up yet?

9
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:27,090
Your body and mind have reached their limits, right?

10
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:46,310
As expected, the master was right about the person Mu Lin.

11
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:47,710
Give him life

12
00:00:47,710 --> 00:00:49,030
Don't let him faint
